				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">mater,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Hor.
					S. 2, 3, 293</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">scriptor,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. Ep. 2, 2, 126</span></i>
			 et saep.</div>
